            <ArticleTitle>Swimming pool-induced asthma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>240-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 13-year-old elite swimmer presented with wheezing after indoor swimming training. On the basis of her clinical history and the tests performed, exercise-induced asthma and mold-induced asthma were ruled out and a diagnosis of chlorine-induced asthma was made.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
